截面"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}, {"source_term": "component", "target_term": "分支"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "connected components", "target_term": "连通分支"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设 <MATH_0001> 是连通（connected）概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 非分歧（unramified）且分离（separated）。每个截面（section）（<MATH_0003> 的）都给出同构（isomorphism），到某个连通（connected）分支（component）上。存在双射（bijective）对应\n<MATHSEG_0001>截面（sections），所对应的态射为 <MATHSEG_0002>连通分支（connected components） <MATHSEG_0003> ，取自 <MATHSEG_0004> ，满足<MATHSEG_0005>诱导映射（induced map） <MATHSEG_0006> 是同构（isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0007>\n特别地，给定 <MATH_0004>，至多有一个截面（section）经过 <MATH_0005>。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:708107288b07348fd1356096af73a731000a1f803475883852156b583ed0a6ab", "unit_id": "tag:024U:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "暂定译名，修饰给定概形和所述分支。", "source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指定理中的几何对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指给定态射的一项条件。", "source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指给定态射的另一条件。", "source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指所给态射的截面。", "source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指截面到分支的同构及对应式中的诱导映射性质。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指截面映到的连通分支。", "source_term": "component", "target_term": "分支"}, {"context": "暂定译名，修饰两类对象之间的对应。", "source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指对应式左边的全部截面。", "source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指对应式右边选取的分支。", "source_term": "connected components", "target_term": "连通分支"}, {"context": "暂定译名，指从分支到基底的映射。", "source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}]}
